WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.267
♪♪

00:00:04.267 --> 00:00:05.634
-We're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.634 --> 00:00:09.100
While touring the demilitarized
zone on Thursday,

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.400
Vice President Kamala Harris
mistakenly said

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.367
the U.S. has, quote,
"an alliance

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:15.701
with the Republic
of North Korea."

00:00:15.701 --> 00:00:19.067
It's a huge blunder that many
are calling presidential.

00:00:19.067 --> 00:00:22.000
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.868 --> 00:00:26.267
Supreme Court Justice
Clarence Thomas's wife Ginni

00:00:26.267 --> 00:00:28.968
testified on Thursday before the
house committee investigating

00:00:28.968 --> 00:00:32.200
the Capitol attack in
a four-hour closed-door session,

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.601
and no matter how much
the committee begged her,

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:37.000
she would not open the door.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.501
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.501 --> 00:00:41.267
The National Archives said last
week they still did not have

00:00:41.267 --> 00:00:42.834
custody of all missing records

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:44.601
from former President Trump's
administration.

00:00:44.601 --> 00:00:47.367
And this is absolutely
the first time Donald Trump

00:00:47.367 --> 00:00:49.601
has ever fought someone
for custody.

00:00:49.601 --> 00:00:52.400
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:53.801
[As Trump] It's all yours.

00:00:53.801 --> 00:00:57.567
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.567 --> 00:00:59.133
[Normally] According
to newly-released documents,

00:00:59.133 --> 00:01:01.534
the FBI spent years
surveilling the late singer

00:01:01.534 --> 00:01:03.901
Aretha Franklin, which isn't
surprising if you've seen

00:01:03.901 --> 00:01:06.868
and of her performances
from the '60s.

00:01:06.868 --> 00:01:09.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.968 --> 00:01:16.634
So I guess that's an FBI agent.

00:01:16.634 --> 00:01:18.434
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.434 --> 00:01:20.400
Ordering from a giant menu.

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:23.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.234 --> 00:01:29.367
The FBI used to dress like
"Inspector Gadget."

00:01:29.367 --> 00:01:32.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:34.834
When he was preparing to leave
Walter Reed Medical Center

00:01:34.834 --> 00:01:37.133
in 2020 after being treated
for the coronavirus,

00:01:37.133 --> 00:01:40.133
then-President Trump reportedly
told aides he wanted to exit

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:43.334
